# CostGuard — Azure Infrastructure Cost Impact Predictor

> A standalone CLI tool and FinOps circuit breaker that analyzes Terraform execution plans *before* infrastructure deployment, calculates estimated monthly cost impacts using the official **Azure Retail Prices API**, caches pricing records locally via **SQLite**, and blocks deployments when cost increases exceed a configured budget ceiling.

---

## 1. Project Overview

Cloud infrastructure costs can quickly spiral out of control if engineers do not have visibility into the financial consequences of their Infrastructure as Code (IaC) changes. **CostGuard** acts as a pre-deployment financial firewall. By analyzing the JSON representation of a Terraform plan (`terraform show -json tfplan`), CostGuard detects proposed resource creations, deletions, and modifications, retrieves live consumption prices from Microsoft's official Azure Retail Prices API, and enforces organizational FinOps guardrails directly within CI/CD pipelines.

---

## 2. Architecture

```text
Terraform JSON Plan (File or Piped Stdin)
                    │
                    ▼
          Terraform Plan Parser
                    │
                    ▼
          Resource Extraction
          (Address, Action, SKU, ARM Region)
                    │
                    ▼
      Billable Resource Filter
      ├── Non-billables (RG, VNet, Subnet) ──► Skipped (₹0.00)
      └── Billable (VMs, Managed Disks)
                    │
                    ▼
              SQLite Cache (pricing_cache.db)
               /            \
          HIT /              \ MISS
             ▼                ▼
     Return Rate        Azure Retail Prices API
                              │
                        Filter Non-Spot Consumption
                              │
                        Write-through to SQLite
                              │
                              ▼
                     Pricing Engine
                              │
                              ▼
               Monthly Cost Calculation
               (Hourly Rate × 730 hrs/month)
                              │
                              ▼
               Terraform Action Matrix Delta
               ├── CREATE:  +New Cost
               ├── DELETE:  -Old Cost (Savings)
               ├── UPDATE:  New Cost - Old Cost
               └── NO-OP:   ₹0.00
                              │
                              ▼
                  Budget Guardrail Policy
                              │
                     ┌────────┴────────┐
                     ▼                 ▼
                 [PASSED]          [FAILED]
                 Exit 0            Exit 1
             Deployment OK    Circuit Breaker:
                              Deployment Blocked
```

